risk_amount / stop_distance

Then apply:

- minimum quantity
- quantity step
- maximum quantity
- maximum exposure
- account constraints

Position sizing must be deterministic.

Log:

account equity
risk budget
stop distance
raw quantity
normalized quantity
final quantity

